  "id": "ecstatic-trance",
  "term": "ecstatic trance",
  "definition": "Ecstatic trance is a trance-like state of prolonged semi-consciousness or profound sleep in which the person also shows the mental attitude and facial expression associated with ecstasy. The term is used when trance is accompanied by this distinctly ecstatic mental state.",
